::EM U5 p34 Gra1.0 Expressions of quantity some/many/much/+:: Choose the correct words in italics to complete the sentences.

::EM U5 p34 Gra1.1:: Would you like  ____ rice with your chicken? {
	=some
	~a few
}

::EM U5 p34 Gra1.2:: I mustn't eat too  ____ chocolate — it's bad for me! {
	~many
